00:04:15.625 --> 00:04:18.765
Uh, are there any other corrections that need to be made,

00:04:19.744 --> 00:04:20.195
um.

00:04:21.070 --> 00:04:25.149
All in favor or is there a motion to approve the minutes as they've been

00:04:25.149 --> 00:04:28.269
corrected, uh, motion from Mr.

00:04:28.279 --> 00:04:28.579
Little.

00:04:31.079 --> 00:04:31.600
Thank you.

00:04:32.260 --> 00:04:32.989
Seconded by the chair.

00:04:33.029 --> 00:04:34.910
All in favor, please indicate I opposed.

00:04:34.970 --> 00:04:35.750
