00:04:46.779 --> 00:04:49.029
The mayor has won special recognition tonight.

00:04:49.170 --> 00:04:53.149
5A is a proclamation recognizing Huntsville Hospital Health System 1 100

00:04:53.149 --> 00:04:55.570
years of babies celebration.

00:04:56.390 --> 00:04:56.989
Mayor Battle.

00:04:59.399 --> 00:05:00.359
Thank you, Madam President.

00:05:00.440 --> 00:05:06.959
If I could ask, uh, Tracy Dowdy and Elizabeth Sanders and the whole baby

00:05:06.959 --> 00:05:09.140
team, in fact, if they would come forward,

00:05:09.519 --> 00:05:14.290
uh, for this proclamation, one that we are very proud to be making tonight.

00:05:18.450 --> 00:05:23.170
As they come forward, I might mention to everybody that um Huntsville Hospital

00:05:23.170 --> 00:05:27.359
has been servicing our community for over 131 years.

00:05:27.809 --> 00:05:32.799
And in 1926, June 11th, 1926, they welcomed their first baby,

00:05:33.170 --> 00:05:38.170
Buddy Miller, and that started for 100 years of delivering babies in the

00:05:38.170 --> 00:05:40.910
city of Huntsville and this North Alabama area.

00:05:41.559 --> 00:05:45.130
Uh, I have a number of whereass, and I've already hit 2 of them,

00:05:45.209 --> 00:05:47.750
so I'm gonna save you all those, uh, real quick.

00:05:48.250 --> 00:05:51.730
But whereas generations of families have trusted Huntsville Hospital to

00:05:51.730 --> 00:05:54.589
care for them during some of life's most meaningful moments,

00:05:54.970 --> 00:05:59.329
uh, and I've had that opportunity also with a son born there and two grandsons

00:05:59.329 --> 00:05:59.970
born there.

00:06:00.500 --> 00:06:03.739
Uh, whereas generations of families have trusted Huntsville Hospital to

00:06:03.739 --> 00:06:06.220
care for them during the life's most meaningful moments,

00:06:06.339 --> 00:06:10.079
whereas Huntsville Hospital Health System is recognizing the historic milestone

00:06:10.619 --> 00:06:13.929
through a commemorative 100 years of babies celebration,

00:06:14.380 --> 00:06:17.820
whereas our nonprofit community-based hospital plays a vital role in the

00:06:17.820 --> 00:06:20.579
health and well-being of children and families throughout our city,

00:06:20.739 --> 00:06:24.660
county, and region, whereas Huntsville Hospital has continuously advanced

00:06:24.660 --> 00:06:26.459
the care for mothers and babies.

00:06:26.890 --> 00:06:30.609
And whereas the legacy continues today through Huntsville Hospital for Women

00:06:30.609 --> 00:06:34.130
and Children, which delivers more babies annually than any other hospital

00:06:34.130 --> 00:06:38.769
in Alabama and Madison Hospital, which has expanded access to high quality

00:06:38.769 --> 00:06:43.010
maternity care for one of the state's fastest growing communities.

00:06:43.209 --> 00:06:46.720
And whereas the city of Huntsville proudly recognizes and celebrates the

00:06:46.720 --> 00:06:53.250
nurses, physicians, and care teams, which is all uh represented right here.

00:06:53.820 --> 00:06:58.019
Uh, that have impacted families across our community for the last 100 years.

00:06:58.220 --> 00:07:01.260
Now, therefore, I, Tommy Battle, mayor of the city of Huntsville,

00:07:01.660 --> 00:07:05.839
do hereby recognize 100 years of babies at Huntsville Health Hospital Health

00:07:05.839 --> 00:07:09.179
System and honor the extraordinary legacy of care,

00:07:09.339 --> 00:07:13.100
compassion, and commitment that has touched generations of families throughout

00:07:13.100 --> 00:07:13.670
our community.

00:07:14.540 --> 00:07:17.720
Thank you very much for all that y'all have done for our community.

00:07:23.399 --> 00:07:26.779
Now Tracy, please give us some words of wisdom,

00:07:27.040 --> 00:07:31.000
OK, uh, on behalf of our board of trustees and our senior leadership team,

00:07:31.279 --> 00:07:32.119
thank you all.

00:07:32.279 --> 00:07:35.579
Thanks to the mayor and our city council for recognizing us today.

00:07:36.160 --> 00:07:41.190
Uh, we've delivered over 350,000 babies in our 100 years,

00:07:41.359 --> 00:07:44.480
