00:07:53.709 --> 00:07:56.309
Um, I just thank you, thank you for the honor.

00:07:56.390 --> 00:07:59.059
Um, we couldn't do this without the team that we have.

00:07:59.350 --> 00:08:02.369
We have incredible staff at the hospital and incredible providers.

00:08:02.660 --> 00:08:06.989
Um, we're just thankful to play a part into our community and to bring,

00:08:07.000 --> 00:08:09.980
um, these lives into the world and help, um,

00:08:09.989 --> 00:08:13.829
continue to grow a stronger Huntsville and I'm proud to see where we go

00:08:13.829 --> 00:08:15.450
in the, uh, next few years.

00:08:16.230 --> 00:08:18.690
Whenever they say, Huntsville's growing and they're growing too fast,

00:08:18.750 --> 00:08:19.700
I'm gonna point at y'all.

00:08:21.600 --> 00:08:22.420
Thank you very much.

00:08:24.940 --> 00:08:25.609
I appreciate you.

00:08:29.500 --> 00:08:30.279
All right.

00:08:31.100 --> 00:08:31.809
Thank you.

00:08:32.140 --> 00:08:32.820
Sure, thank you.

00:08:46.409 --> 00:08:46.789
Everybody.

00:08:53.099 --> 00:08:53.479
Thank y'all.

00:08:54.580 --> 00:08:55.390
