01:07:31.250 --> 01:07:34.879
On Saturday, a week ago, it would be 2 weeks this coming Saturday,

01:07:35.449 --> 01:07:38.669
I was passing the sportsplex on Patton Road,

01:07:39.169 --> 01:07:46.550
as I often do, where there were likely hundreds of sports people there enjoying

01:07:46.669 --> 01:07:47.770
sporting games.

01:07:48.679 --> 01:07:54.580
I noticed directly across Patton Road where there are three small apartment

01:07:54.580 --> 01:08:01.479
buildings, 3607, 3609, and 3611 Patton Road.

01:08:02.429 --> 01:08:10.419
On the street just inches away from the pavement were 11 garbage carts of

01:08:10.419 --> 01:08:11.239
waste management.

01:08:12.719 --> 01:08:20.799
Their lids were open and all 11 were running over with large amounts of

01:08:20.799 --> 01:08:27.879
garbage on the ground for those visitors to see for each federal employee

01:08:27.879 --> 01:08:31.250
that passes that each morning going to work to see,

01:08:31.720 --> 01:08:34.540
including federal employees probably from Colorado,

01:08:34.759 --> 01:08:38.160
and I bet they would never see anything like that where they came from.

01:08:39.078 --> 01:08:44.207
I initiated an attempt to get the city to address the issue.

01:08:44.899 --> 01:08:47.040
And tried for 6 days.

01:08:49.450 --> 01:08:51.049
At 4:50 this evening.

01:08:52.060 --> 01:08:57.660
That was still all that stuff was still there but probably 100% more on

01:08:57.660 --> 01:08:58.120
the ground.

01:08:59.479 --> 01:09:07.930
Apparently There are no ordinances governing this issue.

01:09:08.969 --> 01:09:12.269
So I guess I'll give up on trying to get the city to correct it,

01:09:12.809 --> 01:09:17.368
and on Monday I will seek help from the county health department because

01:09:17.368 --> 01:09:19.627
if without a doubt it is a health issue.

01:09:20.207 --> 01:09:23.499
I'm sure that flies are swarming all over that place.

01:09:24.048 --> 01:09:28.328
